    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_denki_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "D3D284EC17F4C2B2",
      "text": "欢迎来到酿光道馆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_denki_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "D3D283EC17F4C0FF",
      "text": "我要登记一下\\n挑战者的名字……\\r\\n你是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，没错吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_denki_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "D3D282EC17F4BF4C",
      "text": "想和本道馆的\\n馆主奇树对战，\\r\\n需要先通过道馆测验才行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_denki_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "D3D281EC17F4BD99",
      "text": "酿光道馆的道馆测验\\n就是[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]出演奇树的节目[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_denki_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "D3D280EC17F4BBE6",
      "text": "奇树还是个视频直播主。\\n请你出演她的视频，\\r\\n把节目点燃吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_denki_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "D3D27FEC17F4BA33",
      "text": "至于详细情况，\\n你出去后应该就会明白了。",
